<reference id="Nss-SecurityDashboardDeviceExt-3373D910" xml:lang="en" class="- topic/topic       reference/reference "><title class="- topic/title ">Security Dashboard Device Ext (nss-SecurityDashboardDeviceExt)</title><shortdesc class="- topic/shortdesc ">This component allows you to configure the <uicontrol class="+ topic/ph ui-d/uicontrol ">Retry
Trigger</uicontrol> and the <uicontrol class="+ topic/ph ui-d/uicontrol ">Data Importer</uicontrol> and
is added to the <uicontrol class="+ topic/ph ui-d/uicontrol ">NiagaraStation</uicontrol> in the <uicontrol class="+ topic/ph ui-d/uicontrol ">NiagaraNetwork</uicontrol> when the station has a Security Service
that is not in fault.</shortdesc><prolog class="- topic/prolog "><metadata class="- topic/metadata "><keywords class="- topic/keywords "><indexterm class="- topic/indexterm ">nss-SecurityDashboardDeviceExt</indexterm><indexterm class="- topic/indexterm ">component</indexterm></keywords></metadata></prolog><refbody class="- topic/body        reference/refbody "><section class="- topic/section "><p class="- topic/p "> The default view is the Security Dashboard view, which
shows the single station dashboard view for the <uicontrol class="+ topic/ph ui-d/uicontrol ">NiagaraStation</uicontrol> or reachable station. The system security dashboard view is not
available.</p><image placement="break" scope="local" width="600" href="../graphic/nss-SecurityDashboardDeviceExt.png" class="- topic/image "/><p class="- topic/p ">The component is added dynamically
to the <uicontrol class="+ topic/ph ui-d/uicontrol ">NiagaraStation</uicontrol>.</p></section><properties class="- topic/simpletable reference/properties "><prophead class="- topic/sthead      reference/prophead "><proptypehd class="- topic/stentry     reference/proptypehd ">Property</proptypehd><propvaluehd class="- topic/stentry     reference/propvaluehd ">Value</propvaluehd><propdeschd class="- topic/stentry     reference/propdeschd ">Description</propdeschd></prophead><property class="- topic/strow       reference/property "><proptype class="- topic/stentry     reference/proptype ">Retry Trigger</proptype><propvalue class="- topic/stentry     reference/propvalue ">additional properties (see <uicontrol class="+ topic/ph ui-d/uicontrol ">control-TimeTrigger</uicontrol> component in <ph conkeyref="doctitles_coresw/Niagara4UserGuide-90E05C89" class="- topic/ph "/>.</propvalue><propdesc class="- topic/stentry     reference/propdesc ">Reattempts to get the security dashboard information from
the remote station in the event that the regularly scheduled attempt
failed.</propdesc></property><property class="- topic/strow       reference/property "><proptype class="- topic/stentry     reference/proptype ">Data Importer</proptype><propvalue class="- topic/stentry     reference/propvalue ">additional properties (see <uicontrol class="+ topic/ph ui-d/uicontrol ">nss-SecurityDashboardDataImport</uicontrol>)</propvalue><propdesc class="- topic/stentry     reference/propdesc ">Contains a trigger to regularly get dashboard data from
the remote station. It has standard properties to let you know if
the import has succeeded.</propdesc></property></properties><section class="- topic/section "><title class="- topic/title ">Actions:</title><p class="- topic/p "><b class="+ topic/ph hi-d/b ">Retry</b>: Manually reattempts
to get security dashboard data as configured.</p></section></refbody></reference>